      "item": "dropbear-feature-removed-binary",
      "reason": "No private pinned Dropbear source/configuration input is present in this host workspace; the exact binary hash and source-semantics hash cannot be honestly materialized.",
      "successor_method": "Provide a private SHA-pinned Dropbear source tree or archive, build the bound static feature matrix, refresh this manifest from the produced binary, then independently review it.",
